{"id":"occasion","lemma":"occasion","pos":"noun","rank":873,"glosses":["occasion, opportunity","cause","bargain, good deal"],"ipa":"/ɔ.ka.zjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/55/Fr-occasion.ogg/Fr-occasion.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"occasions"},"formAudio":{"occasions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Dorveille_%28Nucleos%29-occasions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est une bonne occasion.","en":"This is a good opportunity.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},null]},{"text":"Ce sera une excellente occasion.","en":"This will be a great opportunity.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"excellent","l":"excellent"},null]},{"text":"Vous avez eu plein d'occasions.","en":"You had plenty of opportunity.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"full, full up"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Tu dois profiter de cette occasion.","en":"You must take advantage of the opportunity.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to take advantage of"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Je les vis ensemble à plusieurs occasions.","en":"I saw the two together on several occasions.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"together"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"several, many, a lot"},null]}]}